{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Something happened at this school\u2014long ago.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SCHOOL EXIT CLASS 8</i> is a first-person horror game where you wander through looping hallways in search of subtle anomalies. There is only one rule:<br><strong>If you notice something strange, turn back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classrooms, restrooms, the nurse\u2019s office\u2014<br>No matter where you go, <strong>the Eye</strong> is watching, and <strong>the Hand</strong> is reaching for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden within the anomalies are fragments of a tragedy that once occurred at this school.<br><strong>Can you uncover the reason you\u2019re trapped here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Features<br>\u2022 51 eerie anomalies in the full version<br>\u2022 Explore not just hallways, but also classrooms, restrooms, and the nurse\u2019s office<br>\u2022 Short, 5\u201315 minute looping sessions focused on observation<br>\u2022 Haunted by the <strong>Grudgeful Eye</strong> and <strong>Cursed Hand</strong> that follow your every move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you reach the exit\u2026</strong><br><br><br><br><strong>or will it be someone else\u2014someone inside you?</strong><br><br><strong></strong>School Exit \u2013 An Exit 8-Like Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We allow influencers and content creators to stream, share gameplay videos, and monetize content of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* update 20250809 \u3000</strong>Bug Fixes and Improvements</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887110?t=1754857956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887110/9d2d92ffe249e1214b489d6d4114b2cb702f2330/page